At Houston’s @agnesandsherman, one of our Best New Restaurants of 2026, chef @_nickwong_’s Cheeseburger Fried Rice brings together deeply browned beef, a tangy patty melt sauce, and barely wilted lettuce, all sitting under a solid blanket of melted American cheese.

@shilpauskokovic adapted the recipe so you can easily pull it off on a weeknight, and honestly, it’s exactly as good as it sounds.

Comment “🍔” to get the recipe in your DMs.
